# 基本文章編集 (design 11.2.6, 11.26): ディスク操作 chosen in the text's menu is done by the program
# ディスク操作, as the figure editor does it. The menu opens at 400,400 (閉じる under the pointer
# the first time; ディスク操作 260 below, at 440,660; its submenu to the right, 接続, 切り離し and
# 状態表示 20 pixels apart from 661), and 状態表示 shows the system's disk.
# Keys: Esc 29, Ctrl+E 08 01.
waitwin 原紙箱
click 1000 48
wait 300
mkbig doc 1
xml <tad version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"><document>
xml <p>仮身の前<link id="019a6c9b-e67e-7a35-a461-0d199550e4cf_0.xtad" vobjid="01a10000-0000-7000-8000-000000000001" width="160" heightpx="19" chsz="14"/>仮身の後</p>
xml <p>後の段落</p>
xml </document></tad>
xmlbig
logmark
pdoc big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 2
wait 800
logmark
click 400 400 1
expectsince document: menu
wait 500
move 430 660
wait 150
move 440 660
wait 300
shot dd_menu
move 510 660
wait 150
move 530 661
wait 300
move 530 701
wait 300
click 530 701
expect disk: status "TessronOS system"
expect diskop: up status
wait 1000
shot dd_status
key 28
expect diskop: status closed
wait 500
key 08 01
expect document: closed
absent !OACV!
